    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Holy Deadline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A narrative experience about gods, fate, and divine paperwork.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Aeon</strong>, son of Yahweh, freshly resurrected after a short (and possibly illegal) holyday on Earth. Now you\u2019re back in <strong>Heavenly Office</strong>, stuck doing celestial legal work for a week. Your first task is to<strong> handle the divine divorce of Adam and Eve.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only retreat is a bizarre, shifting bar at the edge of Heaven. But something\u2019s wrong with the universe itself, and <strong>someone</strong> is watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/cd68b0744e578fd470f40578994d176c.poster.avif?t=1752500137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/cd68b0744e578fd470f40578994d176c.webm?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/cd68b0744e578fd470f40578994d176c.mp4?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Heavenly Office dramedy  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process <strong>absurd legal requests</strong> from historical icons, from Cleopatra\u2019s royal drama to Julius Caesar's lawsuit against Brutus. Keep Heaven\u2019s bureaucracy and your boss\u2019s temper from imploding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/881195cefabba32ef5678d01560bcc3a.poster.avif?t=1752500137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/881195cefabba32ef5678d01560bcc3a.webm?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/881195cefabba32ef5678d01560bcc3a.mp4?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Logic vs Artistry: your words shape the world  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>Logic</strong> or <strong>Artistry</strong> stats through your legal choices! Unlock unique dialogue paths or special endings. Can\u2019t figure it out? Take a risky chance and <i>let fate decide.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/3bb6e0274cb9da7304c6fd3cef5b8b06.poster.avif?t=1752500137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/3bb6e0274cb9da7304c6fd3cef5b8b06.webm?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/3bb6e0274cb9da7304c6fd3cef5b8b06.mp4?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Gods, secrets, and coworkers  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dad is a deity. Your bestie runs the only bar in Heaven. Your coworkers are a bunch of goofy gossiping angels. Every conversation uncovers secrets, memories, or something worse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/8ab7febe92b6cf4dc3dfa0ecb5d6a285.avif?t=1752500137\" data-has-big /></span>Your notebook keeps secrets  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track everything: clues, character insights, even awkward divine confessions.  Connect the dots between cases, lies, and lore.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/5993286886acfe97b40be8d987edfb7b.poster.avif?t=1752500137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/5993286886acfe97b40be8d987edfb7b.webm?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/5993286886acfe97b40be8d987edfb7b.mp4?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A bar that changes every night  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, you return to the bar at the edge of Heaven.  Talk to angels, demons, and forgotten gods over drinks.\u00a0<strong>You have one week. Don\u2019t waste it.</strong><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/61e9d1027a92432d296e7b640ee4b348.avif?t=1752500137\" data-has-big /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play cards, make bonds!<strong>  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night, you play cards with your friends and become closer. Who you choose determines the memories, secrets, and bonds you unlock.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/eb710e18f2239bc85f1c4b37f04f1c66.poster.avif?t=1752500137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/eb710e18f2239bc85f1c4b37f04f1c66.webm?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/eb710e18f2239bc85f1c4b37f04f1c66.mp4?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legal drama meets celestial comedy </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative-driven gameplay with branching dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games: give mortals legal help, file papers  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Notebook that tracks lies, loyalties, and lore  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card game with friends and secret reveals  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stylish, character-driven aesthetic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/0d4303f656a282281b4e2adbbf97f409.poster.avif?t=1752500137\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/0d4303f656a282281b4e2adbbf97f409.webm?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438670/extras/0d4303f656a282281b4e2adbbf97f409.mp4?t=1752500137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
